      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm trying to get serious about my weight loss and want to start using caffeine and green tea extract together every morning to really kickstart my metabolism. i drink like 4-5 cups of coffee a day so i have a pretty high tolerance. what's the max effective dose i should take of both combined to get the best results?",
