      "role": "user",
      "content": "the 400mg limit feels a bit low for someone like me though, i usually feel fine even when i have more than that. i'm looking for that extra edge to really push my fat burning. if i'm just doing this for a few weeks to jumpstart things, what's the absolute upper limit i can go for both to get the max metabolic effect? i want to go aggressive with it.",
